Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Record AVBufferPool and AVRefStructPool lifecycle events
Upstream: ffmpeg 9.0.1
Upstream-Archive: https://ffmpeg.org/releases/ffmpeg-9.0.1.tar.xz
Upstream-SHA256: cf38e0e28c7e5605942c4a77755349b0145804a397af37eb1fb4c77cb237f635
Build-Variants: traced native decoder; ported native and Capstone replays
Depends-On: none (pristine release)
Apply-From: upstream source root, with patch --batch --forward --fuzz=0 -p1

Add recording guards, pool and callback events, and recorder objects in
libavutil/Makefile. Reject callback configurations unsupported by the replay.
The build copies trace.h, ff2_record.c and ff2_observe.c from this component
into the prepared tree; their implementations remain ordinary src/ files.

